course: dictionary
lesson: 12223
title: Consecutive: one after another
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Consecutive means following one after another in order, with no gap. Think of children standing in a line for a bus, each one right behind the one before. The idea is always of things coming in a row.
explain: «The bus was late for three consecutive days.» That means one day, then the next day, then the day after that. No normal day comes in between, so the days follow each other in order.
explain: Maths uses this word a lot. 4, 5, 6 are consecutive numbers because they come one after another. 6, 8, 10 are consecutive even numbers because they go up by 2 each time. Always check: is there a gap? If there is, the numbers are not consecutive.
fact: Consecutive means following one after another in order, without a gap.
fact: Consecutive numbers come one after another: 4, 5, 6.
fact: Consecutive even numbers go up by 2 each time: 6, 8, 10.
fact: Puzzle: the three consecutive numbers that add to 24 are 7, 8 and 9.
fact: A team that wins «three consecutive games» has won three games in a row.
exercise: «Ella read for five consecutive nights.» What does consecutive mean here? | On five nights with a rest night between each | On five nights, but in different towns | *On five nights in a row, one after another | On one night only
exercise: Which set of numbers is consecutive? | 8, 10, 13 | 3, 6, 9 | 2, 5, 9 | *8, 9, 10
exercise: Find three consecutive numbers that add to 24. Which are they? | 9, 10, 11 | 5, 9, 10 | 4, 6, 14 | *7, 8, 9
test: «The shop was closed on two consecutive Sundays.» What does consecutive mean? | Two Sundays with several weeks between them | *Two Sundays one after another | Two Sundays that were sunny | Two Sundays in different towns
test: Which list shows consecutive even numbers? | *10, 12, 14 | 1, 4, 9 | 3, 4, 5 | 5, 10, 15
exam: «Sam scored in three consecutive matches.» What does this mean? | Three matches on the same day | Three matches in three different sports | *Three matches in a row, one after another | Three matches that Sam lost
